    <h2>Kitchen and bathroom remodels</h2>
    <p>A remodel is the cheapest moment to fix a kitchen's wiring. We add the dedicated circuits a modern kitchen needs, GFCI protection by every sink, and lighting planned around the new layout, working to your contractor's timeline.</p>
    <h2>Bungalow lighting</h2>
    <p>Millbrook's bungalows have low ceilings and few original fixtures. Slim LED wafer lights and good dimmers make those rooms feel bigger without cutting into the plaster more than we must.</p>
    <h2>Small businesses</h2>
    <p>For shops and cafés we handle new circuits for equipment, exit and emergency lighting, and the paperwork the inspector expects before you open.</p>
